  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PIMS-9624 Integrated Conservation Management and Restoration of High-Value Landscapes in Uzbekistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the GEF PPG is to develop the project concept into a full project: Integrated Conservation Management and Restoration of High-Value Landscapes in Uzbekistan. As described in the child project concept note, this project aims to improve land restoration, SLM, and biodiversity conservation at the systemic level, catalyzing upscaling in foothills and mountains throughout Uzbekistan. The project includes policy coherence, cross-sectoral cooperation, and innovative financing and techn</narrative>
  </description>
